---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Residential Locksmith in Delaware | House Lockout & Lock Services | 1st Capital Locksmith"
  description="1st Capital Locksmith provides professional residential locksmith services throughout Delaware. House lockouts, lock rekeying, deadbolt installation, lock repair, lock replacement, and mailbox lock service for homes and apartments across Kent County."
>

  <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-3">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500 flex-wrap">
        <li>
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Home</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
          <a href="/services/" class="hover:text-[#A61E22] transition font-medium">Services</a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold">Residential Locksmith</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Schema Markup for Breadcrumbs -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.1stcapitallocksmith.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Services", "item": "https://www.1stcapitallocksmith.com/services/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Residential Locksmith", "item": "https://www.1stcapitallocksmith.com/services/residential-locksmith/" }
    ]
  })} />
  <!-- Schema: Service -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "Residential Locksmith in Delaware",
    "description": "Professional mobile residential locksmith services throughout Delaware — house lockouts, lock rekeying, deadbolt installation, lock repair, lock change, and mailbox lock replacement. 1st Capital Locksmith serves Dover, Milford, Smyrna and all of Kent County.",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "1st Capital Locksmith",
      "telephone": "+13027350050",
      "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "addressLocality": "Dover", "addressRegion": "DE", "addressCountry": "US" }
    },
    "areaServed": { "@type": "State", "name": "Delaware" },
    "serviceType": "Residential Locksmith"
  })} />

  <!-- Schema: FAQ -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How quickly can you respond to a house lockout in Delaware?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "We prioritize lockout calls and dispatch as fast as possible to your location throughout Delaware. Response times vary based on your location and current demand. Call (302) 735-0050 and we'll give you an honest estimate of our arrival time." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Should I rekey or replace my locks when I move into a new home?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "In most cases, rekeying is the right choice. It's faster, more affordable, and just as effective as full replacement — it simply reconfigures the lock so previous keys no longer work. Lock replacement makes more sense if the existing hardware is low quality, damaged, or you want to upgrade to a higher security level." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How much does it cost to rekey a house in Delaware?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Rekeying costs depend on the number of locks and the type of hardware. We provide a clear upfront quote before any work begins. Call us at (302) 735-0050 for a fast estimate based on your specific situation." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Can you make a copy of my house key on-site?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Our mobile locksmiths carry key cutting equipment and can duplicate most standard residential keys on-site at your home throughout Delaware. If you need a transponder key or a high-security key, call us first and we'll confirm compatibility." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do you work with landlords and property managers?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Absolutely. We regularly work with landlords and property managers throughout Delaware who need rekeying between tenants, lock replacements, or other residential locksmith services across multiple properties." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "What should I do if I'm locked out of my house late at night?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Call us at (302) 735-0050. We respond to residential lockouts throughout Delaware and will get to you as quickly as possible. Do not attempt to force entry yourself — this almost always causes expensive damage to your door or lock." } }
    ]
  })} />
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section
    class="relative min-h-[340px] md:min-h-[550px] flex items-center text-white py-10 md:py-20"
    style="background-image: url('/images/residential-locksmith.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: top-center;"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/70"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-6 z-10">
      <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-xs md:text-sm mb-2 md:mb-4">Residential Locksmith Services</p>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-3 md:mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-tight">
        Residential Locksmith in Delaware — Keeping Delaware Homes Safe & Secure
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm md:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-5 md:mb-8">
        Locked out of your house? Need your locks rekeyed after moving in? Want to upgrade your deadbolts for better protection? 1st Capital Locksmith provides trusted residential locksmith services to homeowners, renters, and landlords throughout Delaware — and we come directly to you.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 md:gap-4">
        <a
          href="tel:3027350050"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-white font-bold text-base md:text-lg hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
        >
          Call (302) 735-0050
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact/"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white px-6 py-3 md:px-8 md:py-4 text-white font-semibold text-sm md:text-base hover:bg-white hover:text-[#1A1F22] transition"
        >
          Get a Free Quote
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust Bar -->
  <section class="bg-[#0E1B2F] py-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">All Home Types</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Houses, Apartments, Condos & Rentals</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Mobile</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">We Come Directly to Your Home</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Fast</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Quick Response Across Delaware</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Upfront</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Clear Pricing Before We Start</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Delaware's Residential Locksmith</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6 leading-snug">
            Professional Residential Locksmith Services Throughout Delaware
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Your home is your most important investment, and the locks on your doors are your first line of defense. Whether you've just moved into a new house and want the peace of mind that comes with fresh locks, you've been locked out and need back in quickly, or you're simply ready to upgrade your home's security, 1st Capital Locksmith is the residential locksmith Delaware homeowners trust.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We work with all types of residential properties — single-family homes, apartments, condos, townhouses, and rental units. Our locksmiths understand that having someone working on your home's locks is a matter of trust, and we take that seriously. We arrive on time, explain exactly what we're doing, and leave your home more secure than we found it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            We are fully mobile and serve homeowners throughout Dover, Milford, Smyrna, Camden, Harrington, and all of Kent County, Delaware. Whatever your residential lock or key need, we have the tools and experience to handle it on-site.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6">Our Residential Locksmith Services Include:</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            {[
              "House Lockout Service",
              "Lock Rekeying",
              "Deadbolt Installation & Upgrade",
              "Lock Repair",
              "Lock Replacement",
              "Mailbox Lock Replacement",
              "Sliding Door Lock Service",
              "Duplicate House Key Made On-Site",
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-700">
                <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
            <a
              href="tel:3027350050"
              class="w-full inline-flex justify-center items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-6 py-3 text-white font-bold hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
            >
              Call (302) 735-0050 Now
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services Detail -->
  <section id="services" class="bg-[#F8F8F5] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">What We Do</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">
          Residential Locksmith Services in Delaware
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Here is a detailed look at every residential locksmith service we provide to homeowners and renters throughout Delaware. Not sure what you need? Just give us a call and we'll point you in the right direction.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">

        <!-- House Lockout -->
        <div id="house-lockout" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 9.75L12 3l9 6.75V21a1 1 0 01-1 1H4a1 1 0 01-1-1V9.75z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 22V12h6v10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">House Lockout Service in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Being locked out of your own home is one of the most stressful situations you can find yourself in — especially late at night, in bad weather, or with young children waiting outside with you. It happens more often than most people think, and when it does, you need a residential locksmith who can get there quickly and get you back inside without any damage.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              1st Capital Locksmith responds to house lockouts throughout Delaware. Our locksmiths use professional non-destructive entry techniques that open your door without harming the lock, the door frame, or the surrounding trim. We work on all types of residential locks including standard knob locks, deadbolts, lever handles, and keypad entry systems.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Whether you're locked out of your front door, a back door, a bedroom, or a bathroom, we can help. Give us a call and we'll get to you as quickly as possible so you can get back inside and get on with your day.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Lock Rekeying -->
        <div id="lock-rekeying" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Lock Rekeying in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Moving into a new home is exciting, but here's something many people don't think about right away — you have no idea how many copies of your new house keys are floating around out there. Previous owners, old tenants, contractors, real estate agents — any one of them could still have a working key to your front door. Rekeying your locks the moment you move in is one of the smartest and most affordable things you can do for your family's security.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Rekeying changes the internal pin configuration of your existing lock so that all previous keys stop working and only your new keys will open the door. It's faster and less expensive than <a href="/services/lock-change/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">replacing the entire lock</a>, and in most cases the result is just as secure. 1st Capital Locksmith performs residential rekeying throughout Delaware, on-site at your home.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Beyond new home move-ins, we also recommend rekeying when keys go missing, after a roommate moves out, or after any situation where you're uncertain about who might have access to your home. It's a small investment that pays for itself in peace of mind.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Deadbolt Installation -->
        <div id="deadbolt" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 118 0m-4 8v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Deadbolt Installation & Upgrade in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              If your exterior doors only have a basic knob lock or an older deadbolt, your home's security may not be as strong as you think. A quality deadbolt is one of the most effective deterrents against forced entry — and the difference between a standard deadbolt and a properly installed high-security deadbolt is significant.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              1st Capital Locksmith installs and upgrades deadbolts for homes throughout Delaware. We carry quality residential deadbolts from trusted brands and can recommend the right option based on your door type, your security concerns, and your budget. We also make sure the installation is done correctly — a poorly installed deadbolt provides far less protection than one that's properly set and aligned.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Whether you need a new deadbolt added to a door that doesn't have one, or you want to replace an older lock with something more robust, we handle the entire job on-site. We also install double-cylinder deadbolts, keypad deadbolts, and smart lock deadbolts depending on your preference.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Lock Repair -->
        <div id="lock-repair" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Residential Lock Repair in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Locks don't always fail all at once — they usually give you warning signs first. A key that's getting harder to turn, a deadbolt that doesn't fully extend, a knob that feels loose or rattles in the door — these are all signs that your lock needs attention before it becomes a real problem. A lock that's struggling is a lock that could fail at the worst possible moment.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              1st Capital Locksmith diagnoses and repairs residential locks throughout Delaware. In many cases a lock can be repaired quickly and affordably on-site, saving you the cost of a full replacement. Our locksmiths take the time to properly assess what's going on before recommending a solution, so you only pay for what you actually need.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              If your lock was damaged during a break-in attempt, exposed to weather damage, or has simply worn down from years of use, call us and we'll get it working properly again. A well-maintained lock is a reliable lock.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Lock Replacement -->
        <div id="lock-replacement" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Residential Lock Replacement in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Sometimes a lock is simply past the point of repair — the hardware is too worn, too damaged, or too outdated to provide reliable security. Other times, homeowners want to upgrade to a better quality lock altogether. Either way, 1st Capital Locksmith makes residential lock replacement straightforward and hassle-free throughout Delaware.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              We carry a selection of quality residential lock hardware and can replace any lock in your home on the same visit. Whether it's your front door, back door, garage entry door, or interior room locks, we handle it all on-site. We also make sure the new lock is properly fitted to your door for smooth, reliable operation.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              If you're not sure whether your lock needs repair or replacement, just call us. We'll take an honest look and give you a straightforward recommendation — no unnecessary upselling.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mailbox Lock -->
        <div id="mailbox-lock" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Mailbox Lock Replacement in Delaware</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Your mailbox contains more sensitive information than most people realize — bank statements, credit card offers, medical documents, and personal correspondence all pass through it regularly. A broken or compromised mailbox lock puts all of that at risk. If your mailbox key is lost, your lock is damaged, or you've moved into a new place and aren't sure who has the key, getting the lock replaced is a smart and simple security step.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              1st Capital Locksmith replaces <a href="/services/mailbox-lock-replacement/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">mailbox locks</a> for homeowners and apartment residents throughout Delaware. We work on standard residential mailboxes, cluster mailbox units, wall-mounted boxes, and post-mounted units. It's a quick service that we handle on-site, and we provide new keys on the spot.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Don't overlook your mailbox security. It's a small lock, but what it protects can have a big impact on your personal and financial privacy. Call us to get it sorted quickly and affordably.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Choose Us -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Why Choose Us</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">
          Why Delaware Homeowners Choose 1st Capital Locksmith
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          When it comes to your home's security, you deserve a locksmith you can genuinely trust. Here is why homeowners throughout Delaware call us first.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
